        rate |    7.1407     5.5485
          se |    1.3049     0.9739
------------------------------------
Overall maximum convergence ratio: 0.046 (criterion: below 0.25; met)
Convergence t-ratios (criterion: all below 0.1 in absolute value): met

. estat gof, nsim(100) seed(7)

Goodness of fit: Mahalanobis distance test
