. 
. * Add a smoother triadic closure effect (gwesp) and out-popularity
. nwsaom, waves(glasgow1 glasgow2 glasgow3) outdegree reciprocity gwesp(.69) transtrip indegpopularity outactivity outpo
> pularity seed(1)

SAOM (Method of Moments, conditional), waves: glasgow1 glasgow2 glasgow3
Actors: 50                             Periods: 2

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
